Claim classification
--------------------
Exact:
- displaced Hamiltonian and Bogoliubov transformation;
- cancellation of the anomalous quadratic term;
- algebraic ladder actions;
- equality of recursive and independent finite-sum organizations.

Formal:
- fixed-n Rayleigh--Schrodinger coefficients through eta^(-2/3);
- spacing and second-difference expansions.

Conjectural:
- global Olver domain chain;
- equivalence of C_ess=0 with the exact Delta_WI spectrum;
- the O(u^-1) relative Weber connection remainder.

Open:
- a rigorous perturbative remainder uniform in n;
- growing-n uniformity;
- the global Olver connection theorem.

The complete W-to-Psi pullback, neutral W1/W2 labels, endpoint cancellation,
and Wronskian definition of C_ess are preserved unchanged.

